    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Josefu na muka wa Potifa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waishmaeli wikamdwa Josefu hata Misri, wikamuuza kwa Potifa, umu wa wabaa wa mzuri; nao orekoghe m'baa wa walindiri wa nyumba ya mzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukakaia andwamweri na Josefu, ukawona nicha kwa ghose oreghibonyereghe; nao ukakaia nyumbenyi kwa uja bwana wake Mmisri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 7.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Potifa ukawona angu BWANA orekoghe andwamweri na Josefu kwa seji BWANA orekoghe ukirasimia ghose gherebonyeroghe ni mikonu yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu ukarumirikia mesonyi kwake, nao ukam'bonya ukaie mdumiki wake, sena ukammbika ukaie m'baa aighu ya vilambo na nyumba yake yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata nyuma ya Josefu kuwikwa ukaie m'baa wa vilambo na nyumba yose ya Potifa, BWANA ukairasimia ija nyumba ya Mmisri kwa wundu ghwa Josefu, irasimio ja BWANA jikakaia aighu ya vose orekoghe navo, nyumbenyi na mbuwenyi wori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwu Potifa ukamsighia Josefu wuzighaniri ghose, hata nderesumbukieghe ilagho jingi izima ela vindo vake veni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu moni orekoghe uumbikie nicha sena ughokie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao nyuma kapindi, muka wa bwana wake ukazoya kumzighana kwa bea, ukamzera, “Ndedilalanye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ukalegha na kumzera uo muka wa bwana wake, “Zighana bwana wapo ndesumbukiagha vilambo va nyumbenyi kwake angu niko aha, nao waniwikie mzighaniri wa vilambo vake vose; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hata uo moni ndenichumbie kwa wubaa andenyi ya nyumba ihi, sena ndenighirie kilambo chingi, ela oho kumoni kuekeri kwa kukaia koko muka wake. Idana idimika wada kwapo ini nighubonye wuwiwi ghung'ane huwu, na kum'bonyera Mlungu kaung'a?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hata ngera orekoghe ukidedanya nao ituku ituku, Josefu ndererumirieghe wei wilalanye, hata kukaianya nao anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ituku jimu, iji Josefu orengirieghe nyumbenyi kubonya wudumiki ghwake, na mdumiki ungi mzima nderekoghe nyumbenyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uja muka ukammbwada nguwo ukamzera, “Ndedilalanye.” Ela Josefu ukailekeria nguwo yake, ukakimbia cha shighadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja muka uendawona angu wasighilwa nguwo, na Josefu wakimbia cha shighadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukawiwanga wadumiki wa nyumbenyi kwake ukawizera, “Zighanenyi wadiredie uhu Muebrania uchedidukana! Wangia aha ukikunda ulale nani, ngakema na lwaka lubaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao uendasikira nakema, ukakimbia cha shighadi ukanisighia nguwo yake.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukaiwika ija nguwo hata mumi wake ukacha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukamghoria ghaja malagho gheni ukighamba, “Uhu mdumiki Muebrania kumredie aghadi kodu wanichea ukikunda kunidukana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela iji nakema kwa lwaka lubaa, ukakimbia cha shighadi na kunisighia nguwo yake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji bwana wake wasikira ghaja malagho, ukajokwa ni machu loli-loli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukammbwada Josefu na kumngira kifungonyi andu wafungwa wa mzuri werekoghe wikifungwa, ukakaia aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela BWANA orekoghe andwamweri na Josefu, ukamrasimia na kum'bonya urumirikie mesonyi kwa m'baa wa kifungonyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 7.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'baa wa kifungonyi ukam'bonya Josefu ukaie mzighaniri wa wafungwa wambao wose, na kazi rose rerebonyekagha aho, rerebonyeroghe kwa nguma yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja m'baa wa kifungonyi ndereisumbukieghe kazi ingi iyo yose erekoghe mikonunyi kwa Josefu, angu BWANA moni orekoghe andwamweri na Josefu, na icho chose orechibonyereghe, BWANA ukachirasimia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
